  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Daryl Caudle said he is not satisfied with where the Navy is in its AI journey. He also said he is \"100% ‘all ahead flank’ on AI.\" Caudle stated that the era of platform-centric thinking is over and that the way the Navy fights today will not be the way it fights tomorrow.",
